@Checador.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5085
@consultaAuth = Basic <BASE64_USER_COLON_PASSWORD>
@adminTempAuth = Basic <BASE64_ADMIN_TEMP>

### health
GET {{Checador.Api_HostAddress}}/health/status
Accept: application/json

###

### login (define local credentials)
POST {{Checador.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "<USUARIO_LOCAL>",
  "password": "<PASSWORD_LOCAL>"
}

###

### preview (consulta/admin)
GET {{Checador.Api_HostAddress}}/preview?userId=1&from=2026-04-01T00:00:00&to=2026-04-02T23:59:59
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{consultaAuth}}

###

### preview all (consulta/admin)
GET {{Checador.Api_HostAddress}}/preview/all?from=2026-04-01T00:00:00&to=2026-04-02T23:59:59
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{consultaAuth}}

###

### kpi (consulta/admin)
GET {{Checador.Api_HostAddress}}/kpi?from=2026-04-01T00:00:00&to=2026-04-02T23:59:59
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{consultaAuth}}

###

### admin users (admin only)
GET {{Checador.Api_HostAddress}}/admin/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{adminTempAuth}}

###

### change password (admin temporal -> definitivo)
POST {{Checador.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminTempAuth}}

{
  "currentPassword": "<ADMIN_TEMP_PASSWORD>",
  "newPassword": "<ADMIN_NEW_PASSWORD>"
}

###
